\newlabel{fig:mech}{{3}{16}{Widening the hyper-parameter search of kernel ridge closes most of the gap to the Gaussian-process reduced model, and a Gaussian process on the full field is as good as the POD-based one. Error ratio of each alternative to the reduced-basis Gaussian process in the \KrrNarrowN {} budget--problem combinations where that model clearly beats the best network (own-solver problems, budgets 64, 256, 1024); boxes show quartiles, dots individual combinations, the dashed line a factor of three}{figure.3}{}}
